notes = "Legacy presentation alias, not a current executable native action. The current producer declares only action.spell.telekinesis.move and the initial spell.telekinesis; their explicit finite source assignments own accepted attempts. Actual forced movement, hostile save, landing damage and Prone UUID retain their own ordered presentation owners. This empty disabled-body alias neither creates a second cast nor invents a held restraint/grab condition. Current source boundary: dnd/spells/transmutation.py TelekinesisMove and _resolve_telekinetic_transfer; no grab/restrain native action template is registered. All assigned artwork remains unreviewed."
